      "en": "“Don’t slander a servant to his master, lest he curse you, and you be held guilty.",
      "ko": "너는 종을 그 상전에게 훼방하지 말라 그가 너를 저주하겠고 너는 죄책을 당할까 두려우니라",
      "source_text_hash": "e11f15657c6f61da3e18f6fd09b5ce8fcd003df012eb518bd77e65d39970add4",
      "translation_text_hash": "9f61aadb6302467ef6ca7a1f6d1b8289686e1158288df2239761cb81b67ea37f",
